# Constraints

- Preserve the existing Sense inventory exactly; do not add, remove, merge, split, or reorder Senses.
- Generate only themed definitions and examples. Do not regenerate lexical metadata or modify the neutral Word.
- Do not alter the target expression's established meaning or usage to accommodate the Theme.
- Do not present invented details as established canon when adapting an existing fictional universe.
- Do not treat the supplied thematic elements or scenarios as exhaustive or mandatory.
- Do not sacrifice semantic fidelity or linguistic naturalness to achieve stronger thematic expression.
- Respect the requested content counts for every Sense.

